OL,3,GNEWSAChurch war memorial repair fund
OL,4,Aappeal tops #8,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn appeal launched to help fund the
OL,7,Frestoration of a church's vandalised
OL,8,Fwar memorial has so far raised more
OL,9,Fthan #8,000.
OL,11,FThe statue depicting Jesus Christ on a
OL,12,Fcross at St Alban's Roman Catholic
OL,13,Fchurch in Warrington was damaged and
OL,14,Fdaubed with graffiti last month.
OL,16,FParishioners at the church in Bewsey
OL,17,Fsaid the response had been "amazing"
OL,18,Fand added that they were "extremely
OL,19,Fgrateful" for everyone's "kindness and
OL,20,Fsupport".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
